   "properties": {},
   "title": "About this workflow",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## MiniMax-H3 continuation: three 5 s clips, one 15 s video\nEach clip starts on the **Last Frame** of the clip before it. **Stitch Continuation Clips** joins them and drops the repeated seam frame (with matching audio).\n\nModels and settings match the Oct 6 Pillars run (pruned FL2VA Q4_K_M GGUF, Qwen3-VL 32B GGUF, 4-step turbo LoRA, 768x1344, 124 frames per clip).\n\n**Memory:** as one job, the three decoded clips stay in RAM next to H3. Run it on Comfy Cloud or a machine with more than 32 GB of RAM. On 32 GB, run each clip as its own job and stitch at the end."
   ]
  }
